| `Gate2SdkConfig`, `Gate2Theme`, `SdkLogLevel` | `com.gate2.sdk.core.config` |
| `Gate2Esim.start` / `.resumeAfterPayment` / `.showMyEsims` / `.isAvailable` / `.isDeviceEsimCapable` | `com.gate2.sdk.esim` |
